{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124048","id":4697155840,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF_jpAA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124048","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124048.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124048.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124048","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124048/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124048/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124048/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/46fd6f224069172602cbebca5520197e60fadf6f","number":124048,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix \"Ignore external changes\" overwriting other scenes with the current one","user":{"login":"calbebop","id":70987281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTg3Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70987281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop","html_url":"https://github.com/calbebop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #117489\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen the \"Files have been modified outside Godot\" dialog appears and you pick **Ignore external changes**, the editor writes the *currently edited* scene into every file listed in the dialog, instead of writing each open scene back to its own file.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n`_resave_externally_modified_scenes()` looped over the changed paths and called `_save_scene(scene_path)` with no tab index. `_save_scene()` falls back to the current tab when the index is omitted. This means that for each path it serialized the current tab's scene tree into that path, and refreshed the current tab's modified-time bookkeeping instead of the affected tab's.\r\n\r\n## Symptoms\r\n- A base scene gets overwrittten with a copy of the scene that inherits from it, producing a self-inheriting file and a \"Circular reference\" error\r\n- The affected tab's modified time is never updated, so the dialog reappears every time the editor regains focus\r\n- A duplicate tab for the same file\r\n- A crash when switching back to the inherited scene's tab (shown by the backtrace in [the issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117489))\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe fix reuses `save_scene_list()`, which already covers this exact \"save these specific scenes, each in its own tab\" case for FileSystem dock moves, group renames, and built-in script saves:\r\n\r\n- `disk_changed_scenes` becomes a `HashSet<String>` so it can be handed to `save_scene_list()` directly\r\n- `save_scene_list()` walks the open tabs and saves each one whose root `scene_file_path` is in the set, passing that tab's index to `_save_scene()`\r\n\r\nTabs with no root are skipped, which is the right outcome since `_save_scene()` can't save a rootless tab and would only show the \"can't be done without a tree root\" warning.\r\n\r\nTested on Windows against the issue's reproduction project, following both @KoBeWi's and @matheusmdx's steps.\r\n\r\n**AI disclosure:** I designed the test plan, wrote, and reviewed the changes. Opus was used for initial research and localized testing.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admi